checked-in stub blob, relocation dump, and disassembly via `make -C
src/stub arm64-win64.pe.h` on Linux, using the current `upx-stubtools`.

Assisted-by: GPT-6 Sol
Signed-off-by: Johannes Schindelin <johannes.schindelin@gmx.de>
